OL,3,GNEWSATeens held after man punched and
OL,4,Akicked unconscious
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree teenagers have been arrested over
OL,7,Fan assault after a man was found
OL,8,Funconscious in Nottingham city centre.
OL,10,FPolice were called to Clumber Street at
OL,11,F01:15 BST on Saturday where witnesses
OL,12,Fsaid a man had been punched and kicked
OL,13,Fby a group of people.
OL,15,FAn 18-year-old man and two boys, 13 and
OL,16,F16, have been arrested on suspicion of
OL,17,Fcommitting grievous bodily harm with
OL,18,Fintent and remain in police custody.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
