OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Insp Ian Smith said the victim's
OL,7,Finjuries "aren't as serious as
OL,8,Finitially thought" and the man was
OL,9,Ftaken to hospital for treatment to a
OL,10,Fbroken nose.
